			dependencies: ["79457A83C076F6D6"]
			description: ["You are going to want a good source of ores. The little land you are on will certainly have some, but may not have all you will need. You could head to the mining dimension to get some ores, or create an orechid to generate some. Another option is to head to the bottom of the world and build a cobble generator on top of bedrock (this won't get as many types of ores though)."]
